{"content_hash": "b441ea74a7253ba4", "version_id": 863, "article_id": 87, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Hitcard eyes backdoor listing with stake in solar firm Yamanan", "title_zh": "Hitcard 拟收购亚玛顿控股权，疑似借壳上市", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8192045.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589759829060-eb3e3a77cdee?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8aGl0Y2FyZHxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzNzU2MTA1fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Fearghal Kelly on Unsplash", "author": "Fearghal Kelly", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@fgal?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/text-5OgIsvOO1Rk?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(21, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(59, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "f08d1f69b25e"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-04", "word_count": 187, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "A Chinese trading-card brand is buying a big stake in a loss-making solar glass company. The deal looks like a shortcut to a stock market listing, because the brand's own IPO plan has stalled.", "lead_zh": "一家中国卡牌品牌正收购一家亏损光伏玻璃公司的大笔股份。由于该品牌自身的上市计划受阻，这笔交易看起来像是通往股市的捷径。", "preview": "Yamanan (002623.SZ) said on November 2 that its controlling shareholder, Yamanan Technology, plans to sell 20% of its shares to Shanghai Qix", "preview_zh": "亚玛顿（002623.SZ）11月2日表示，其控股股东亚玛顿科技拟将20%股份转让给运营卡牌品牌Hitcard的上海骑形网络。亚玛顿股票自11月3日起停牌，交易价格尚未确定。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 846, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 74.325, "size_bytes": 446976, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 215, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@48085d2/content/data/versions/863.json", "paragraphs": ["Yamanan (002623.SZ) said on November 2 that its controlling shareholder, Yamanan Technology, plans to sell 20% of its shares to Shanghai Qixing Network, which runs the trading-card brand Hitcard. Trading in Yamanan shares stopped on November 3, and the price has not been fixed yet.", "Hitcard has tried to go public before, but rival card makers such as Kayou and Suplay have also struggled to list. The deal requires Yamanan to be able to issue shares and restructure its assets. If that is impossible, Hitcard can end the agreement and take back a 50 million yuan deposit.", "Yamanan makes solar glass, and its business has suffered as the solar industry slowed. Revenue fell from 3.63 billion yuan in 2023 to 2.04 billion yuan in 2025, and the company lost money in both 2024 and 2025. The Lin family, which controls the firm, twice failed to buy an upstream supplier.", "The Lin family still holds about 17.76% after the sale, so Hitcard's lead is small. Investors now wait to see whether Hitcard puts its card business into the listed company, and what happens to the solar glass unit."], "paragraphs_zh": ["亚玛顿（002623.SZ）11月2日表示，其控股股东亚玛顿科技拟将20%股份转让给运营卡牌品牌Hitcard的上海骑形网络。亚玛顿股票自11月3日起停牌，交易价格尚未确定。", "Hitcard此前曾尝试上市，但卡游、Suplay等同行也上市不顺。该交易要求亚玛顿具备发行股份和重组资产的能力。若无法实现，Hitcard可终止协议并收回5000万元保证金。", "亚玛顿主营光伏玻璃，随着光伏行业降温，其业务受到冲击。营收从2023年的36.3亿元降至2025年的20.4亿元，公司在2024年和2025年均亏损。控股的林氏家族曾两次收购上游供应商失败。", "交易后林氏家族仍持有约17.76%股份，因此Hitcard的领先优势并不大。投资者正观望Hitcard是否会将卡牌业务注入上市公司，以及光伏玻璃业务将如何处置。"], "body": "Yamanan (002623.SZ) said on November 2 that its controlling shareholder, Yamanan Technology, plans to sell 20% of its shares to Shanghai Qixing Network, which runs the trading-card brand Hitcard. Trading in Yamanan shares stopped on November 3, and the price has not been fixed yet.\n\nHitcard has tried to go public before, but rival card makers such as Kayou and Suplay have also struggled to list. The deal requires Yamanan to be able to issue shares and restructure its assets. If that is impossible, Hitcard can end the agreement and take back a 50 million yuan deposit.\n\nYamanan makes solar glass, and its business has suffered as the solar industry slowed. Revenue fell from 3.63 billion yuan in 2023 to 2.04 billion yuan in 2025, and the company lost money in both 2024 and 2025. The Lin family, which controls the firm, twice failed to buy an upstream supplier.\n\nThe Lin family still holds about 17.76% after the sale, so Hitcard's lead is small. Investors now wait to see whether Hitcard puts its card business into the listed company, and what happens to the solar glass unit.", "body_zh": "亚玛顿（002623.SZ）11月2日表示，其控股股东亚玛顿科技拟将20%股份转让给运营卡牌品牌Hitcard的上海骑形网络。亚玛顿股票自11月3日起停牌，交易价格尚未确定。\n\nHitcard此前曾尝试上市，但卡游、Suplay等同行也上市不顺。该交易要求亚玛顿具备发行股份和重组资产的能力。若无法实现，Hitcard可终止协议并收回5000万元保证金。\n\n亚玛顿主营光伏玻璃，随着光伏行业降温，其业务受到冲击。营收从2023年的36.3亿元降至2025年的20.4亿元，公司在2024年和2025年均亏损。控股的林氏家族曾两次收购上游供应商失败。\n\n交易后林氏家族仍持有约17.76%股份，因此Hitcard的领先优势并不大。投资者正观望Hitcard是否会将卡牌业务注入上市公司，以及光伏玻璃业务将如何处置。", "text": "Yamanan (002623.SZ) said on November 2 that its controlling shareholder, Yamanan Technology, plans to sell 20% of its shares to Shanghai Qixing Network, which runs the trading-card brand Hitcard. Trading in Yamanan shares stopped on November 3, and the price has not been fixed yet. Hitcard has tried to go public before, but rival card makers such as Kayou and Suplay have also struggled to list. The deal requires Yamanan to be able to issue shares and restructure its assets. If that is impossible, Hitcard can end the agreement and take back a 50 million yuan deposit. Yamanan makes solar glass, and its business has suffered as the solar industry slowed. Revenue fell from 3.63 billion yuan in 2023 to 2.04 billion yuan in 2025, and the company lost money in both 2024 and 2025. The Lin family, which controls the firm, twice failed to buy an upstream supplier. The Lin family still holds about 17.76% after the sale, so Hitcard's lead is small. Investors now wait to see whether Hitcard puts its card business into the listed company, and what happens to the solar glass unit.", "vocab": [{"word": "controlling shareholder", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "控股股东", "note": "指持股比例最高、能控制公司的股东", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "stake", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份", "note": "常用 buy/sell a stake in 某公司", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "backdoor listing", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "借壳上市", "note": "通过收购上市公司实现上市", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "go public", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "上市", "note": "也可说 list", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rival", "pos": "noun", "zh": "竞争对手", "note": "形容词用法也很常见", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "restructure", "pos": "verb", "zh": "重组", "note": "名词形式为 restructuring", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "deposit", "pos": "noun", "zh": "保证金", "note": "此处指交易保证金", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "revenue", "pos": "noun", "zh": "营收", "note": "公司经营收入", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "upstream", "pos": "adj", "zh": "上游的", "note": "指供应链前端环节", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unit", "pos": "noun", "zh": "业务部门", "note": "此处指公司旗下业务板块", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-04T01:35:03.845173", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Yamanan", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.825, "sm": 300, "em": 824, "cs": 0, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "(", "s": 0.825, "e": 0.9, "sm": 825, "em": 899, "cs": 8, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "002623", "s": 0.9, "e": 2.25, "sm": 900, "em": 2250, "cs": 9, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": ".", "s": 2.25, "e": 2.475, "sm": 2250, "em": 2474, "cs": 15, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "SZ", "s": 2.475, "e": 2.925, "sm": 2474, "em": 2925, "cs": 16, "ce": 18, "si": 1}, {"i": 5, "w": ")", "s": 2.925, "e": 3.162, "sm": 2925, "em": 3162, "cs": 18, "ce": 19, "si": 1}, {"i": 6, "w": "said", "s": 3.163, "e": 3.337, "sm": 3162, "em": 3337, "cs": 20, "ce": 24, "si": 1}, {"i": 7, "w": "on", "s": 3.337, "e": 3.438, "sm": 3337, "em": 3437, "cs": 25, "ce": 27, "si": 1}, {"i": 8, "w": "November", "s": 3.